From 7800671b5fb995cfc2a3c188adf045b964d1c2e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 01:27:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Testers' survey: roomy notes with a live count, kept in
 view over the phone keyboard; typed keys stay in the text

- 'What looked wrong?' is a 3-row box like the note; caps 600 and 1000 (field and saved row), a live
  '212 / 600' count; a fullest row is about 2 KB, far under the 47 000 cell (test).
- On focus and on every visualViewport resize/scroll the box is scrolled to the middle of what the
  keyboard leaves, with room added under the page while it is up (scrollIntoView as the fallback).
  Checked in Chromium at 412x915 with 500 px left and 915x412 with 190 px left: both boxes visible.
- App.tsx and inputEngine.ts ignore keys typed into a text box: Space, P and R were eaten while typing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FhBbYJYzHh5qAsNs8q9u9d
